{"id":"d7ec083aeafd5af7","group":"28","path":"28/28-thm-toda.md","title":"thm-toda (Toda's Theorem)","display":"thm-toda (Toda's Theorem)","type":"theorem","metadata":{"book":"Computational Complexity: A Modern Approach","book_abbrev":"28","display":"thm-toda (Toda's Theorem)","label":"28-thm-toda","type":"theorem","aliases":["28-thm-toda","Toda Theorem","PH is contained in P^#P"],"depends_on":["[[28-df-ph]]","[[28-df-sharp-p-oracle]]","[[28-thm-sharp-p-oracle-sat]]"],"source_book_location":"Theorem 17.14; printed p.352; PDF p.378","source_printed_pages":"352","source_pdf_pages":"378","source_status":"statement-checked","proof_status":"not-audited","eligible_as_verified_dependency":false},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"book","html":"Computational Complexity: A Modern Approach"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"28"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-toda (Toda's Theorem)"},{"key":"label","html":"28-thm-toda"},{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>28-thm-toda</span><span>Toda Theorem</span><span>PH is contained in P^#P</span></div>"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"3490cd4d54ac2474\" href=\"?note=3490cd4d54ac2474\" title=\"28-df-ph\">28-df-ph</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"ed85cd72838ef590\" href=\"?note=ed85cd72838ef590\" title=\"28-df-sharp-p-oracle\">28-df-sharp-p-oracle</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"575c8521e7d1dd42\" href=\"?note=575c8521e7d1dd42\" title=\"28-thm-sharp-p-oracle-sat\">28-thm-sharp-p-oracle-sat</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_book_location","html":"Theorem 17.14; printed p.352; PDF p.378"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"352"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"378"},{"key":"source_status","html":"statement-checked"},{"key":"proof_status","html":"not-audited"},{"key":"eligible_as_verified_dependency","html":"false"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbf{PH}\">\\(\\mathbf{PH}\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"3490cd4d54ac2474\" href=\"?note=3490cd4d54ac2474\" title=\"28-df-ph\">28-df-ph</a>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbf P^{\\#\\mathbf P}\">\\(\\mathbf P^{\\#\\mathbf P}\\)</span> 是 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"ed85cd72838ef590\" href=\"?note=ed85cd72838ef590\" title=\"28-df-sharp-p-oracle\">28-df-sharp-p-oracle</a> 的确定型多项式时间函数 oracle 语言类，oracle 整数答复按二进制编码。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\#\\mathrm{SAT}\">\\(\\#\\mathrm{SAT}\\)</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbf P^{\\#\\mathbf P}=\\mathbf P^{\\#\\mathrm{SAT}}\">\\(\\mathbf P^{\\#\\mathbf P}=\\mathbf P^{\\#\\mathrm{SAT}}\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"575c8521e7d1dd42\" href=\"?note=575c8521e7d1dd42\" title=\"28-thm-sharp-p-oracle-sat\">28-thm-sharp-p-oracle-sat</a>。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathbf{PH}\\subseteq\\mathbf P^{\\#\\mathrm{SAT}}=\\mathbf P^{\\#\\mathbf P}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathbf{PH}\\subseteq\\mathbf P^{\\#\\mathrm{SAT}}=\\mathbf P^{\\#\\mathbf P}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>定理 17.14 写为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbf{PH}\\subseteq\\mathbf P^{\\#\\mathrm{SAT}}\">\\(\\mathbf{PH}\\subseteq\\mathbf P^{\\#\\mathrm{SAT}}\\)</span>；由本目录新增的#SAT计数定义、保持计数完全性与oracle等价定理，得到这里的类级形式。每个固定层、每个固定语言可有自己的多项式界；不声称跨全部层使用同一个指数。本次核对定理陈述，没有独立审计其随机归约和计数消随机化的完整证明。</p>\n<p>R6证据边界：随机归约与计数去随机化完整证明尚未独立核验。本条可作为有明确来源限制的陈述记录，当前不作为已完成证明核验的依赖。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]